# Root .gitignore — applies to the whole repo.
# Java/Maven-specific rules live in backend/.gitignore.

### Secrets — never commit ###
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

### Private planning notes ###
docs/

### IDEs and editors ###
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.cursor/
*.swp

### OS files ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

### Logs ###
*.log
logs/

### Frontend (later) ###
node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.angular/
CLAUDE.md